      "text": "[9:29PM] #Ojo #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic movement from Customs Checkpoint to Iyana Era, Iyana Ishasi, and down to Afromedia.\nSmooth ride from Afromedia down to Iyana Iba, inward to Volks.\nUncongested traffic ascending Iyana Iba Flyover, inward Mile 2, and underneath the flyover, inward to Igando.\nSteady movement from Volks down to Barracks.\nGood traffic flow from Barracks down to Abule Ado.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
