      "text": "[9:39PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nUnimpeded traffic flow throughout the stretch from Anthony to Maryland Intersection, extending to Odo'yalaro, with Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way experiencing smooth traffic in both directions.\nFluid movement from LASUTH underbridge to Kodesoh Road, complemented by good traffic conditions on Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way in both directions.\nOptimal traffic conditions on both Oba Akran Link Bridge and Airport Link Bridge.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
