      "text": "[9:47PM] #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic movement on Eko Bridge, from NEPA Intersection inward to Apongbon.\nUncongested traffic descending Eko Bridge, inward and ascending CMS Bridge, connecting to CMS.\nSmooth traffic flow descending Eko Bridge, inward Elegbeta Mini Stadium and Ebute-Ero Market, connecting to Eko Bridge.\nGood traffic movement descending Carter Bridge, inward Ebute-Ero Market, Leventis, through UBA Roundabout, connecting Inner and Outer Marina.\nGood vehicular movement on Broad Street stretch to Apongbon underneath the bridge, connecting to Offin Canal Market and Olowogbowo.\nSmooth traffic flow on CMS Bridge, inward to Offin Canal Market stretch, to Ijora Olopa, by NEPA Intersection.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
